{%- comment -%}
  "Chris Shi" as single-stroke cursive, for the signature intro on the
  portfolio index. Letterforms are the public-domain Hershey Script Simplex
  face (Allen V. Hershey, US NBS), laid out and smoothed by a small generator
  (Catmull-Rom through the polyline vertices; the underline flourish is
  hand-authored). Stroke order is writing order — the intro script draws each
  path in sequence by animating stroke-dashoffset.
{%- endcomment -%}
